/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadiks/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadiks","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadiks/nodejsApis/commits/f8e065ff31d47b0c5325807b3f819be125187503/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:48:22Z","email":"sadik70@gmail.com","name":"sadiks"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:48:22Z","email":"sadik70@gmail.com","name":"sadiks"},"message":"feat: production-grade BFF API with JWT auth, Swagger docs, Docker\n\n- Restructured to layered architecture (routes/controllers/services)\n- JWT authentication with access + refresh token flow\n- RBAC middleware (admin/user roles)\n- BFF aggregation endpoint (Promise.allSettled parallel calls)\n- Rate limiting (global + strict auth limiter)\n- Helmet security headers + CORS origin whitelist\n- Swagger UI at /api/docs with OpenAPI 3.0 spec\n- 16 integration tests (Jest + Supertest) — 88% coverage\n- Multi-stage Dockerfile with non-root user\n- GitHub Actions CI (Node 18 & 20 matrix + Docker build)","tree":{"sha":"e27d5d8afa62c6c677bcd3a0d0200aa97a9ce076","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadiks/nodejsApis/git/trees/e27d5d8afa62c6c677bcd3a0d0200aa97a9ce076"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sadiks/nodejsApis/git/commits/f8e065ff31d47b0c5325807b3f819be125187503","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2291541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadiks/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sadiks/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sadiks","id":2291541