 Mojo, Zig\n- Add microservices patterns & anti-patterns (Saga, CQRS, service mesh)\n- Add cloud-native architecture guide with AWS/Azure/GCP service mapping\n- Add AI-native patterns (RAG, agents, MLOps, GenAI architecture)\n- Add curated resources hub (50+ podcasts, 30+ YouTube channels,\n  30+ conferences, newsletters, engineering blogs)\n- Update README, getting-started, and architecture index with new content\n- Reorganize all docs from numbered folders to flat topic-based structure\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1587803eab6b9e2479016401f3baa71aab910fa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nithyeswari/guide/git/trees/1587803eab6b9e2479016401f3baa71aab910fa9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nithyeswari/guide/git/commits/f8df495abd11e8dbb84ea14d753620c8c846f48f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11531013?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nithyeswari/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nithyeswari/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nithyeswari/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nithyeswari/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nithyeswari","id":11531013,"login":"nithyeswari","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTMxMDEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nithyeswari/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nithyeswari/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nithyeswari/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nithyeswari/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nithyeswari/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nithyeswari","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nithyeswari/guide/commit/f8df495abd11e8dbb84ea14d753620c